  "description": "Sherry FitzGerald Lettings are delighted to offer Apartment 73 Abberley Square to the market.This two double bedroom, 4th floor apartment is located in an enviable location next to Tallaght Village.\n\nThe apartment offers ample accommodation throughout with an open plan living/dining/kitchen area granting access to a sizeable, west facing balcony.\n\nThere are two double bedrooms (primary ensuite) complete with fitted wardrobes and a fully tiled main bathroom completes the accommodation.\n\nThere is also a designated parking space in the basement with direct access to the lift.\n\nThe Abberley Square development won't be beaten for convenience of location with ground floor retail units catering to your everyday needs. The Square Shopping Centre is just a short stroll away. Tallaght Hospital, The Civic Theatre, The Luas Red Line and a fantastic road network are all within a stones throw of the development too.",
